-    that the end of its blockquote or list item closes, `close_idx` is its last body line.
-    `indent` is the display column of the opening fence.
-    """
-    n = len(lines)
-    return [(s.open, s.last(n), s.info, s.indent) for s in _scan(lines)[0]]
